An ontological anchor is a small pyramid that turns just above its base, kept in a circle of lamps in the Department of Ontological Stability of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]]. Whoever it is bound to cannot be moved by teleportation magic. [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] took it into his shadow.
